import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 778 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races · The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Representation Qualification","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 778 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races · The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Representation Qualification","no":778,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Myriad Races","Representation Qualification","Anchor Council","Civilizational Weight"],"related":["05-Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","777-Transcended Ones and Myriad Races Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0778_模块4-万族-超脱者的代表资格.md","filePath":"en/0778_模块4-万族-超脱者的代表资格.md"}`),r={name:"en/0778_模块4-万族-超脱者的代表资格.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,d,c){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-778-transcended-ones-and-myriad-races-·-the-transcended-one-s-myriad-rank-representation-qualification" tabindex="-1">Entry 778 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races · The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Representation Qualification <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-778-transcended-ones-and-myriad-races-·-the-transcended-one-s-myriad-rank-representation-qualification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 778 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races · The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Representation Qualification&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 49, 777</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-who-grants-the-transcended-one-qualification-to-represent-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">Introduction: who grants the transcended one qualification to represent Myriad Ranks? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-who-grants-the-transcended-one-qualification-to-represent-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: who grants the transcended one qualification to represent Myriad Ranks?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s transcended one is naturally Myriad Ranks&#39; representative — he is strongest, so he represents. This &quot;strong-one-is-representative&quot; logic is completely abolished in Heng Yuan Zhou. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization must answer a harder question: <strong>one person strong enough for the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm — on what grounds does he represent Myriad Ranks? Why do Myriad Ranks recognize him?</strong> This entry answers this &quot;representation qualification&quot; question.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom requires the representation qualification&#39;s origin be clean; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the qualification be open to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the qualification serve common uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the qualification-acquisition process not disturb Myriad Ranks&#39; causality; the law-first axiom requires the qualification&#39;s law definition be self-consistent and repeatable.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-representation-qualification-s-four-hard-thresholds" tabindex="-1">I. Representation Qualification&#39;s Four Hard Thresholds <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-representation-qualification-s-four-hard-thresholds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Representation Qualification&#39;s Four Hard Thresholds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one must simultaneously cross four hard thresholds to gain Myriad-Rank representation qualification:</p><ol><li><strong>Origin threshold</strong>: all power from the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, zero predatory residue. Those with improper origins cannot even enter the representation-qualification application stage;</li><li><strong>Coverage threshold</strong>: his work history must have benefited over 99% of Myriad Ranks&#39; life forms (five lineages: carbon-based material, energy-condensing, mechanical-constructed, consciousness-information, mixed-mutated), not only humankind;</li><li><strong>Consensus threshold</strong>: the &quot;civilizational consensus degree&quot; in the civilizational-weight formula must be maintained above 0.8 for three consecutive cycles, and the coverage-breadth subitem must not fall below 0.7;</li><li><strong>Procedure threshold</strong>: his cross-plane and cross-time operations must be 100% reported through causal self-discipline, with zero violation records.</li></ol><p>Four thresholds, no substitute. Any one unmet, no matter how strong the transcended one, he is only an &quot;individual strong one,&quot; without Myriad-Rank representation qualification.</p><h2 id="ii-why-strong-is-not-qualification" tabindex="-1">II. Why &quot;Strong&quot; Is Not Qualification <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-strong-is-not-qualification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why &quot;Strong&quot; Is Not Qualification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s logic is &quot;strong = representative&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s logic is &quot;strong ≠ representative.&quot; Three reasons:</p><ul><li><strong>Strength only shows large destructive power, not correct direction</strong>: a strong one with enormous destructive power but wrong direction representing Myriad Ranks equals selling Myriad Ranks out. Entry 706&#39;s multiplication formula already mathematizes this;</li><li><strong>Strength is private ability; representation is public authorization</strong>: one person cultivating to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is his own business, but if he wants to speak for Myriad Ranks, he must go through Myriad-Rank authorization. Authorization is not automatic; it is procedural;</li><li><strong>Strength changes; qualification must be stable</strong>: strong ones make mistakes, go astray, get eroded by inner demons. If &quot;strong = representative,&quot; then once he goes astray, Myriad Ranks are mis-represented.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-representation-qualification-s-acquisition-procedure" tabindex="-1">III. Representation Qualification&#39;s Acquisition Procedure <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-representation-qualification-s-acquisition-procedure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Representation Qualification&#39;s Acquisition Procedure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Representation qualification is not a one-time exam for life tenure, but goes through a dynamic procedure:</p><ol><li><strong>Application</strong>: the transcended one actively submits a representation-qualification application to the Anchor Council, attaching his complete civilizational-weight dashboard;</li><li><strong>Deliberation</strong>: Myriad-Rank representatives deliberate separately by the five lineages — carbon-based material representatives review his origin; energy-condensing representatives review his direction; mechanical-constructed representatives review his procedure; consciousness-information representatives review his coverage; mixed-mutated representatives review his ethics;</li><li><strong>Public notice</strong>: after deliberation passes, the representation qualification is publicized on the Alaya Network for one cycle; any Myriad-Rank being may raise objection;</li><li><strong>Authorization</strong>: after public notice with no objection, the Anchor Council issues a representation-qualification credential, formally granting the transcended one qualification to speak, propose, and vote at the Myriad-Rank level;</li><li><strong>Annual review</strong>: representation qualification is annually reviewed each cycle; any subitem slipping out of threshold suspends qualification; after rectification, it resumes.</li></ol><h2 id="iv-representation-qualification-s-limits" tabindex="-1">IV. Representation Qualification&#39;s Limits <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-representation-qualification-s-limits" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Representation Qualification&#39;s Limits&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gaining representation qualification does not equal gaining ruling power. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s representation qualification has three hard limits:</p><ul><li><strong>No veto right</strong>: the transcended one as representative has only one vote in the Anchor Council, equal to other Myriad-Rank representatives. His &quot;strength&quot; does not give him extra votes;</li><li><strong>Fixed term</strong>: representation qualification is not life tenure; each term has a clear duration; at term end, he must reapply;</li><li><strong>Recallable</strong>: over one-third of Myriad-Rank representatives jointly petitioning may launch a recall procedure. Once recall passes, representation qualification immediately terminates.</li></ul><p>These three limits ensure the transcended one is always Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;employee,&quot; not Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;master.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the old world letting the strongest naturally represent Myriad Ranks equals wasting representation qualification on someone whose &quot;direction is unverified&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou uses four thresholds to filter out those truly worthy</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the origin threshold directly seals predatory strong ones&#39; representation qualification — your power was grabbed; you have no qualification to represent the Myriad Ranks you once robbed</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo naturally &quot;represents&quot; his plane because he is strongest; Heng Yuan Zhou requires Tang Luo to cross four thresholds, otherwise he is only a high-risk individual</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the coverage threshold explicitly requires benefiting 99% of the five-lineages&#39; life forms, directly ensuring representation qualification does not only serve humankind</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: representation qualification&#39;s entire procedure, standards, and deliberation records are opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao; any Myriad-Rank being may audit</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s Myriad-Rank representation qualification is not a &quot;strong-one-natural&quot; privilege, but a &quot;Myriad-Rank-common-authorization&quot; post. Qualification may be gained, annually reviewed, and recalled. This turns the transcended one from &quot;Myriad Ranks&#39; master&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks&#39; employee&quot; — an employee who happens to have 10,000 times the computable power. No matter how strong the employee, he must obey the employer.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/777_模块4-超脱者与万族-总论.html">Entry 777 · Transcended Ones and Myriad Ranks Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const g=i(r,[["render",o]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
